    "section_columns_image_LcD8E9": {
      "type": "Section-Columns-image",
      "blocks": {
        "text_block_EHrbCm": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Peyman_Sailor.jpg",
            "title": "Peyman & Sailor - Nomads Trails",
            "acronyms": "Adventurers | Bikepackers | Climbers",
            "ins_url": "https://www.instagram.com/nomadstrails/",
            "ins": "nomadstrails",
            "share_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@NomadsTrails",
            "more": "Learn More",
            "text": "<p>Peyman & Sailor are intrepid adventurers and lovers of the outdoors. When not bikepacking, they call Lapland, Northern Finland, home. Online, they are known as Nomads Trails, and they have built a loyal following as they adventure around the world. Three years ago, Nomads Trails partnered with SilverAnt for their Africa bikepacking expedition, completely self-supported by bike. We also did an interview that you can read <a href=\"https://silverantoutdoors.com/blogs/the-silverant-blog/nomads-trails-peyman-bikepacking-interview\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>here</strong></a>.<br/>Starting in mid-January 2025, Peyman and Sailor embark on the<strong> Nomads Trails 5-Athlon Expedition</strong>, combining skiing, running, swimming, cycling, and sailing from Nordkapp, Norway, to South Africa. Follow Nomads Trails' journey on their YouTube channel and social media. To celebrate this epic adventure, we've launched a <a href=\"https://silverantoutdoors.com/products/silverant-x-5athlon-nomads-trails\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>special edition titanium gear </strong></a>collection featuring the 5-Athlon logo. Trusted by Peyman and Sailor for over three years of bikepacking, this gear is built for the toughest challenges. By ordering, you directly support the expedition.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "code": ""
          }
        },
        "text_block_VJUiz3": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Algirdas_Wanders.jpg",
            "title": "Algirdas Wanders",
            "acronyms": "Bikepacker | Adventurer | Outdoorsman",
            "ins_url": "https://www.instagram.com/algirdas_wanders/",
            "ins": "algirdas_wanders",
            "share_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCpQflTOnCnQY2_Q8VcCy58w",
            "more": "Learn More",
            "text": "<p>Algirdas has one goal to cycle the world while having a heap of fun doing so. Hailing from Lithuania his adventures have taken him to some of the remotest and untravelled corners of the world. From Tajikistan’s Pamir Highway to Namibia's Skeleton Coast, he has used his own pedal power to get him there! As a bikepacker and outdoorsman, it's important to have ultralight and functional gear. So when Algirdas reached out to SilverAnt we were stoked to partner with him and supply his adventures with lightweight titanium products. Welcome to the Ultralight SilverAnt team!  To learn more about Algirdas you can head over to his YouTube Channel by simply clicking the button provided below. </p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "code": ""
          }
        },
        "text_block_xwFarm": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Reddit_1.jpg",
            "title": "Marek - Bushcraft For The Soul",
            "acronyms": "Bushcraft | Backpacking | Outdoorsman",
            "ins_url": "https://www.instagram.com/bushcraft_for_the_soul/",
            "ins": "bushcraft_for_the_soul",
            "share_url": "https://www.instagram.com/bushcraft_for_the_soul/",
            "more": "Learn More",
            "text": "<p>Marek is a true outdoorsman and bushcraft connoisseur. With years of experience spent in nature providing for himself, he is the ideal partner for SilverAnt to enlist as an Ambassador. Hailing from Munster Germany, you will find him on the weekend in the sanctuary of nature. There isn’t much he can’t do, and that’s why SilverAnt has partnered with Marek to test, improve and build upon our titanium gear. You can learn more about Marek and follow him on Social media below.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "code": ""
          }
        }
      },
