    "section_columns_image_Vgepi4": {
      "type": "Section-Columns-image",
      "blocks": {
        "text_block_HpBDA8": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/IMG_20230705_090121_316.jpg",
            "title": "2 Locos On Wheels",
            "acronyms": "Bikepacker | Adventurer | Explorer",
            "ins_url": "https://www.instagram.com/2locosonwheels",
            "ins": "2locosonwheels",
            "share_url": "https://www.facebook.com/2locosOnWheels",
            "more": "Learn More",
            "text": "<p>Jordi and Bárbara, a middle-aged couple, began their cycling adventure in 2020, preparing their project without a return date. In 2023, to fulfill Jordi's dream, they left their comfortable life, sold all their belongings, and started their bicycle journey around the world. So far, they have visited 18 countries. Their goal on this trip is not to rush from one place to another, but to integrate with the people they meet, learning and exchanging experiences. For them, cycling the world is about living in the moment, embracing the unknown, and appreciating the simple joys in life. Dreams require risk, but the rewards are immeasurable. As long as their bodies hold out, they will share their adventure on social media to inspire others and show that dreams come true for those willing to take the risk. They genuinely have the life I dream of. If you want to learn more about their journeys, feel free to follow them on Instagram and Facebook.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "code": ""
          }
        },
        "text_block_G73Qdg": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Christian_Meier.jpg",
            "title": "Christian Meier",
            "acronyms": "Buschcraft | Outdoor | Trekking | Nature experience",
            "ins_url": "https://www.instagram.com/outdoor_berserker/",
            "ins": "outdoor_berserker",
            "share_url": "https://www.instagram.com/outdoor_berserker/",
            "more": "Learn More",
            "text": "<p>Chris, a devoted nature enthusiast, grew up in the \"Wald Eifel,\" and even as a young boy, he spent a considerable amount of time in the forest. It was during these formative years that his strong connection to nature developed. His profound appreciation for nature and passion for bushcraft have remained steadfast throughout his life. Chris is constantly seeking out new adventures to embark upon. His vision and values align perfectly with the SilverAnt ethos, which is to create gear designed to withstand a lifetime of adventures. Together, we collaborate to explore the beauty of the natural world. You can learn more about Chris and follow his journey on social media below.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "code": ""
          }
        },
        "text_block_d6rPfg": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Moritz_Gebhard.jpg",
            "title": "Moritz Gebhard",
            "acronyms": "Photographer | Bikepacker | Adventurer | Climber",
            "ins_url": "https://www.instagram.com/Pixel291/",
            "ins": "pixel291",
            "share_url": "https://www.instagram.com/Pixel291/",
            "more": "Learn More",
            "text": "<p>Hailing from Italy, Moritz is an Architecture Student living in Milan. When not studying he is found outdoors pursuing his passions. As a keen climber, cyclist, and photographer, he records his adventures.<br/>We met prior to his recent 3 month Bikepacking trip from Canada to Mexico where SilverAnt supported his adventure. We are thrilled to deepen our relationship and support Moritz as he pursues his passions and explores this beautiful world in whatever medium he desires.<br/>You can learn more about Moritz on Social Media or read this dedicated bikepacking article summarising his recent trip.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "code": ""
          }
        }
      },
