    "section_columns_image_mLFiwh": {
      "type": "Section-Columns-image",
      "blocks": {
        "text_block_iNfQ6c": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Gaz.jpg",
            "title": "Gaziano Outdoors",
            "acronyms": "Wild camper | Bushcraft | Adventurer | Explorer",
            "ins_url": "https://www.instagram.com/gaziano_outdoors/?hl=en",
            "ins": "gaziano_outdoors",
            "share_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UChptYuKabOgYGowT9R-a9RQ",
            "more": "Learn More",
            "text": "<p>Gaziano, he's always been a lover of nature and the outdoors. He was fortunate to have grandparents who were mountain guides in Snowdonia, so he spent a lot of his childhood climbing mountains, exploring forests, and skimming stones in rivers and lakes.<br/>His passion for the outdoors endures. He finds solace in nature, engaging in solo wild camping, bushcraft, and outdoor cooking, primarily in the North West of England, North Wales, and the Peak District.<br/>Encountering him on his YouTube channel, we discovered a kindhearted and helpful man, a professional in the outdoors.<br/>Feel free to explore his adventures and camps on his <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UChptYuKabOgYGowT9R-a9RQ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"Gaziano Outdoors YouTube Channel\">YouTube </a>channel, Gaziano Outdoors, and <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/gaziano_outdoors/?hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"Gaziano Outdoors Instagram profile\">Instagram</a>.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "code": ""
          }
        },
        "text_block_frGpJL": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Rob_Smith.jpg",
            "title": "Bushman Smithy Outdoors",
            "acronyms": "Bushman | Adventurer | Bikepacker",
            "ins_url": "https://www.instagram.com/bushman_smithy_outdoors/",
            "ins": "bushman_smithy_outdoors",
            "share_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@bushman_smithy",
            "more": "Learn More",
            "text": "<p>Rob’s Yorkshire childhood unfolded across heather-strewn moors and whispering woodlands—a boundless playground. But in the last six years, the land truly revealed its magic.</p><p>It began with a spark on a crisp autumn evening—dry kindling catching flame as naturally as breathing. That first fire became a doorway. Weekends turned into expeditions: crafting shelters from branches, reading animal tracks like stories, learning the language of the wild.</p><p>The greatest gifts were the souls he met—the forester who taught him which trees sing, the forager who showed him nature’s larder, the kids seeing their first campfire, just as he once had.</p><p>Now, as Rob tends another fire beneath a star-strewn sky, woodsmoke wraps around him like an old friend. The wild gave him belonging. Not just survival, but stories.</p><p>Tomorrow, the moors will call again. Join the adventure—click below to explore his YouTube channel.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "code": ""
          }
        },
        "text_block_WiNc7h": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/image0_1.jpg",
            "title": "Gonzo Wild Camping",
            "acronyms": "Wild Camper | Bushman | Chef | Filmmaker",
            "ins_url": "https://www.instagram.com/gonzowildcamping/",
            "ins": "@gonzowildcamping",
            "share_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@gonzowildcamping",
            "more": "Learn More",
            "text": "<p>Born in the north of the United Kingdom, Mark was fortunate enough to be surrounded by a multitude of outdoor environments. From dramatic coastlines, rolling hills, ancient woodlands, and vast moorland, it was inevitable that he would grow a thirst for the outdoors.<br/>Mark was greatly influenced by his father, who grew up with the old Yorkshire ways and imparted some of his considerable knowledge to Mark, sparking a love of not only nature but of a more peaceful time.<br/>Mark has since become an avid wild camper, with a sprinkle of bushcraft in the mix.  He has a real passion for not only cooking amazing meals outside, but also to help encourage others to cook as well. “A great meal makes a great camp even better” is somewhat of a motto, and sharing food with friends is always a great feeling.<br/>Another passion of Mark's is filmmaking. His wild camping videos on YouTube have a style not found elsewhere in the community. His creative editing, combined with careful music selection, gives each video its own distinctive view of nature.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "https://www.youtube.com/@gonzowildcamping",
            "code": ""
          }
        }
      },
