    "section_columns_image_cb4mqy": {
      "type": "Section-Columns-image",
      "blocks": {
        "text_block_TA6CHE": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/JTT_Wild_Camp.jpg",
            "title": "JTT Wild Camp",
            "acronyms": "Adventurer | Explorer | Outdoor Filmmaker",
            "ins_url": "https://www.instagram.com/jttwildcamp/",
            "ins": "@jttwildcamp",
            "share_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@jttwildcamp/videos",
            "more": "Learn More",
            "text": "<p>From the misty peaks of Hong Kong’s backcountry to the dense forests and rocky coastlines, JTT has built her life around one simple truth—the outdoors is where she feels most alive.<br/><br/>What began as weekend escapes to unwind from city life soon turned into a deep passion for solo camping and minimal gear exploration. With every trip, she chases the quiet rhythm of the wild—the crackle of a small fire, the whisper of the wind through bamboo, the stillness before dawn.<br/><br/>Through her YouTube channel and Instagram, JTT shares more than just breathtaking views. She shares the philosophy of slowing down, of finding beauty in simplicity, and of trusting well-crafted tools that endure the elements.<br/><br/>Each video is a blend of calm storytelling and genuine outdoor craft—whether brewing coffee beside a river, testing titanium gear in the rain, or hiking through unmarked trails.<br/><br/>The wild, for JTT, is not a challenge to conquer but a home to return to.<br/>Join her journey—click below to explore her latest adventures and see SilverAnt gear in action.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "code": ""
          }
        }
      },
